        "cooked": "<p>Heroic Luminary, Newest Legacy, DW Setback, and DW Expat vs Andvanced Ambuscade in Champion Studios with a randomized start.  With Luminary and Ambuscade both having devices, Charged Attacks can get ugly, so watch out!  Still an easy mint.</p>",
