        "id": 235139,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-02-16T14:55:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Between Luminary's ability to synergize with villain card plays and Setback gathering scads of tokens, this was a pretty easy fight. Ambuscade even brought out a shield on his last round and it was still easier to kick his butt directly than try and break through the new obstacle. :)</p>\n<p>What really held my attention was the implication of Ivanka and Felicia? c.c Like... what? Since when?</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-20T17:22:32.660Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
