        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Between Luminary's ability to synergize with villain card plays and Setback gathering scads of tokens, this was a pretty easy fight. Ambuscade even brought out a shield on his last round and it was still easier to kick his butt directly than try and break through the new obstacle. :)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What really held my attention was the implication of Ivanka and Felicia? c.c Like... what? Since when?</p>",
